{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"31409c75f8b6e90a76eae9d0bd18dabadf206154b86d1d9bf79cbab1d7b4e947","digest":{"component_or_area":"autodeploy review deferral","key_entities":["DEPLOY_DEFER_MAX","AUTODEPLOY_REVIEW_INTERRUPT","REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS","DEFAULT_REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS","infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh","tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_review_drain.py","infra/terraform/monitoring_autodeploy.tf","test_defer_bound_default_outlasts_the_apps_own_per_review_cap","DEFER_BOUND_REVIEW_CAP_MULTIPLE"],"problem_keywords":["autodeploy deferral bound","review interrupt","bound exceeded","deploy defer max","review timeout","LLM-Review gate"],"propositions":["DEPLOY_DEFER_MAX bound misses deferred completions by 10–130s during merge bursts, killing in-flight LLM-Reviews and stalling the review gate.","Four review-interrupt firings on 2026-08-12 overshot the 1800s bound (deferred_for: 1810s, 1820s, 1810s, 1930s) at ~10x normal rate during 60+ merge landings.","Raising DEPLOY_DEFER_MAX from 1800s (1.5x REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS) to 2400s (2.0x) absorbs the four observed overshoots and prevents those specific kills.","The bound is a fixed multiple of the app's per-review cap to self-adjust when REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS changes, enforced by a test assertion rather than a floating literal.","At 2400s the deferral only defers a saturated episode; whether Aug-12 episodes were saturated remains unestablished and is not claimed to be fixed by this raise."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787675243926339001,"uuid":"add014e1-d4c1-4e55-bb74-55fd6866ea79"}